value="安定 = 1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=缓存;kind=val;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p5-sig"><mxGeometry x="1161" y="332" width="98" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-93" value="【注記】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p5-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="374" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-94" value="※1 洗浄機は 500 ms ごと、PLC は 3 s ごとに温水器を読む。洗浄機の読出には PLC がキャッシュで直接応答し、温水器を待たない【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p5-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="396" width="1252" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-95" value="※2 温水器の状態が変わってから、DO と読出応答が追従するまで最大 3 s 遅れる（この図では 1.25 s で安定になり、3.0 s でようやく反映）。要求と応答は同じ時刻に描いている：正常時の 1 往復は数十 ms。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p5-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="416" width="1252" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-96" value="※3 普段は装置状態（運転・入口弁・停止 / 継続エラー・加熱・通水・安定・シリアルモード・漏液）だけを読み、応答は十数バイト【推】。状態のエラー bit が立った時だけアラーム詳細を読む（応答 130 バイト超、9600 bps で約 0.15 s）。4-1 参照【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p5-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="436" width="1252" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-97" value="※4 アラームはこの図には描かない。4 を参照。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p5-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="474" width="1252" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-1" name="4-1 温水器アラーム → 重故障 → リセット"><mxGraphModel dx="1380" dy="818" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1380" pageHeight="818" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p6-0"/><mxCell id="p6-table" value="テーブル" style="locked=1;" parent="p6-0"/><mxCell id="p6-sig" value="信号" parent="p6-0"/><mxCell id="p6-1" value="4-1  温水器アラーム → 重故障 → リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-2" value="この図で答えること：温水器がアラームを出したとき洗浄機に何が見えるか／リセット信号の 5 s の間に PLC が済ませること" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1360" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-3" value="凡例：【推】洗浄機・温水器側の前提　【IO】IO 割付　【P】PLC 本案　【未】未定　【定】確定　｜　赤破線枠「無」= 応答なし" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1360" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-4" value="区分" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="100" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-5" value="信号" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="96" width="160" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-6" value="備考" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="96" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-8" value="温水供給中" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-10" value="温水器アラーム" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-12" value="PLC が検知" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-14" value="洗浄機停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-16" value="原因解消" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-18" value="リセット ON&#xa;（約 5 s）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-20" value="リセット OFF・&#xa;チェック" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-22" value="待機" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-23" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-24" value="運転 / 通水" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-25" value="【推】【未】重故障を受けて OFF（※6 参照）" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="160" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-26" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="188" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="188" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-27" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-28" value="温度書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-29" value="【未】停止時に 25.0 を書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="188" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-30" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="216" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="216" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-31" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-32" value="ブザーリセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-33" value="【IO】独立した入力信号" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="216" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-34" style="end