"><mxGeometry x="1061" y="500" width="58" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-130" value="正常" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-sig"><mxGeometry x="1123" y="500" width="32" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-131" value="正常" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-sig"><mxGeometry x="1211" y="500" width="32" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-132" value="アラーム" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=报警;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-sig"><mxGeometry x="661" y="528" width="298" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-133" value="解消済・ラッチ中" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=报警;kind=tbd;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;dashed=1;fontColor=#6b7280;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-sig"><mxGeometry x="961" y="528" width="98" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-134" value="ON" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=加热;kind=on;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-sig"><mxGeometry x="561" y="556" width="98" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-135" value="【注記】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="598" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-136" value="※1 リセットは約 5 s ON で、OFF の瞬間に洗浄機が重故障入力とアラーム bit が正常かを確認し、正常なら解除【推】。そのため PLC はリセットの立ち上がりで：温水器にリセットを送る → すぐ状態を 1 回追加読出 → OFF までに DO と bit をクリアする必要がある【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="620" width="1352" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-137" value="※2 原因が解消していないのにリセット：温水器はアラームのまま、DO はクリアされず、OFF 時のチェックで NG → 解除失敗【推】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="658" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-138" value="※3 軽故障もタイミングは同じ：状態の「継続エラー」bit → 軽故障 DO【推】。温水器は加熱を続け、洗浄機も止まらない。リセットも同じ流れ【推】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="678" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-139" value="※4 アラーム詳細：温水器のアラーム番号と洗浄機が読むアラーム bit は同じ番号体系なので、PLC は番号で直接変換し、1 件ずつの対照表は要らない【推】。詳細読出の応答は長い（約 0.15 s）ので、エラー bit が立った時だけ読む【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="698" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-140" value="※5 洗浄機にはリセットとブザーリセットの 2 つの IO がある【IO】。ブザーリセット → ブザーリセットを送信、リセット → エラーリセット + ブザーリセットを送信（以前決めたやり方を維持）【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="718" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-141" value="※6 重故障を受けた洗浄機が運転 / 通水を切り 25.0 を書く件：まだ未定。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="738" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-142" value="※7 アラーム中は温水器が既に自ら停止しているので、停止 3 フレームの転送に「現在実行不可」の NAK が返る可能性がある【推】。この NAK は通信失敗に数えず、読み戻し結果で判断する。「データ異常」の NAK だけを数える【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="758" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6-143" value="※8 漏液系アラームも同じ：PLC は自分で運転と通水を切らず、洗浄機が重故障を見て自ら止めるのを待つ（決定済）。温水器側で自ら切る方法もあるが、ここでは採用しない。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p6-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="778" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-2" name="4-2 温水器側断線 → PLC がリモート電源を遮断 → リセット"><mxGraphModel dx="1480" dy="898" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="898" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p7-0"/><mxCell id="p7-table" value="テーブル" style="locked=1;" parent="p7-0"/><mxCell id="p7-sig" value="信号" parent="p7-0"/><mxCell id="p7-1" value="4-2  温水器側断線 → PLC がリモート電源を遮断 → リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-2" value="この図で答えること：PLC–温水器間が断線したとき洗浄機に何が見えるか／PLC はどう温水器を止めるか／復旧後の解除方法" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1460" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-3" value="凡例：【推】洗浄機・温水器側の前提　【IO】IO 割付　【P】PLC 本案　【未】未定　【定】確定　｜　赤破線枠「無」= 応答なし" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1460" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-4" value="区分" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="100" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-5" value="信号" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="96" width="160" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-6" value="備考" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="96" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-8" value="温水供給中" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-10" value="断線・&#xa;タイムアウト 1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-12" value="タイムアウト 2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-14" value="タイムアウト 3 =&#xa;通信異常・電源遮断" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-16" value="洗浄機停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-18" value="線復旧・装置再起動" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-20" value="30 s 経過・通信再開" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-22" value="リセット ON&#xa;（約 5 s）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-23" value="⑨" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-24" value="リセット OFF・&#xa;チェック" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-25" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-26" value="運転" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-27" value="【推】重故障を受けて OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="160" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-28" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="188" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="188" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-29" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-30" value="通水" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-31" value="【推】【未】重故障を受けて OFF。装置起動時に ON" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="188" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-32" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="216" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="216" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-33" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-34" value="リモート電源投入" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-35" value="【IO】装置再起動（その前の遮断は省略）" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="216" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-36" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="244" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="244" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-37" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-38" value="温度書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-39" value="【未】停止時に 25.0 を書込。【推】起動時の初期化で 25.0 を書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="244" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-40" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="272" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="272" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-41" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="272" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-42" value="リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="272" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-43" value="【推】画面解除 → 約 5 s ON → OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="272" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-44" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="300" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="300" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-45" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e9e0f2;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="300" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-46" value="重故障 DO" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="300" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-47" value="【P】通信異常をラッチ。リセットかつ通信正常で OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="300" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-48" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="328" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="328" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-49" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e9e0f2;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="328" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-50" value="温度安定 DO" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="328" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-51" value="【P】通信異常時に OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="328" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-52" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="356" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="356" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-53" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e9e0f2;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="356" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-54" value="読出応答（アラーム bit）" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="356" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-55" value="【P】断線中も洗浄機には通常どおり応答" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="356" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-56" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="384" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="384" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-57" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e9e0f2;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="384" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-58" value="書込応答" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="384" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-59" value="【P】スレーブが即応答、値は保持" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="384" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-60" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="412" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="412" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-61" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#fbe4d5;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="412" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-62" value="リモート電源" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="412" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-63" value="【P】通信異常 → 自ら 1 回遮断（決定済）。投入は転送【IO】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="412" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-64" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="440" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="440" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-65" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#fbe4d5;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="440" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-66" value="状態読出" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="440" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-67" value="【推】タイムアウト 1000 ms、リトライ 3 回。電源遮断後は停止。リセット後に再読出【P】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="440" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-68" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColo