-168" value="2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=失败次数;kind=val;fr=1;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="805" y="640" width="32" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-169" value="3" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=失败次数;kind=val;fr=1;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="905" y="640" width="32" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-170" value="異常（ラッチ）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=通信异常;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="905" y="668" width="416" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-171" value="30 s 待ち" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=启动等待;kind=val;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="1061" y="696" width="98" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-172" value="【注記】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="738" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-173" value="※1 タイムアウト 1000 ms・リトライ 3 回は一般的なシリアル通信の設定【推】【P】。応答のない要求は、直後の「無」枠でタイムアウトまで待ったことを表し、失敗回数と判定は同じ時刻に描いている。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="760" width="1452" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-174" value="※2 温水器には通信ウォッチドッグがなく、断線後はシリアルでは止められない【推】。リモート電源は PLC を経由する【IO】ので、PLC は通信異常と判定すると同時に自らリモート電源遮断を 1 回出力し、温水器は電源断で止まる【P・決定済】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="780" width="1452" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-175" value="※3 遮断後、温水器は電源断のままで、PLC はポーリングを止める。洗浄機の次の装置起動（リモート電源投入）で再び通電し、その後は 1-1 どおり 30 s 待つ【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="800" width="1452" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-176" value="※4 両側の断線ともリセットが必要：通信が復旧した後に洗浄機がリセットして初めて重故障 DO をクリアする。温水器がまだ起動していないのにリセット：PLC はクリアせず、OFF 時のチェックで NG → 解除失敗【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="820" width="1452" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-177" value="※5 「データ異常」の NAK が 3 回連続、書込後の読み戻しが 3 回不一致の場合も通信異常とし、同じく電源を遮断する（アラーム bit は別）。「現在実行不可」の NAK は数えず、読み戻しで判断【P】。断線中も PLC は洗浄機の Modbus に通常どおり応答し、洗浄機に 485 異常を出させない【P】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="840" width="1452" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-3" name="4-3 洗浄機側断線 → リセット"><mxGraphModel dx="1380" dy="682" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1380" pageHeight="682" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-table" value="テーブル" style="locked=1;" parent="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-sig" value="信号" parent="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-1" value="4-3  洗浄機側断線 → リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-2" value="この図で答えること：洗浄機が PLC と読み書きできないとき、誰が温水器を止めるか／復旧後の解除方法" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1360" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-3" value="凡例：【推】洗浄機・温水器側の前提　【IO】IO 割付　【P】PLC 本案　【未】未定　【定】確定　｜　赤破線枠「無」= 応答なし" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1360" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-4" value="区分" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="100" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-5" value="信号" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="96" width="160" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-6" value="備考" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="96" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-8" value="温水供給中" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-10" value="断線" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-12" value="洗浄機 読出失敗" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-14" value="PLC が断線判定" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-16" value="洗浄機停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-18" value="線復旧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-20" value="リセット ON&#xa;（約 5 s）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-22" value="リセット OFF・&#xa;チェック" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-23" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-24" value="アラーム読出異常" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-25" value="【推】読出失敗 3 回でアラーム、表示のみで停止しない。画面で無条件解除" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="160" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-26" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="188" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="188" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-27" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-28" value="アラーム読出" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-29" value="【推】500 ms。無応答ならタイムアウト後に次の読出" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="188" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-30" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="216" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="216" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-31" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-32" value="運転 / 通水" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-33" value="【推】重故障を受けて OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="216" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-34" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="244" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="244" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-35" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-36" value="リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-37" value="【推】画面解除 → 約 5 s ON → OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="244" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-38" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="272" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="272" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-39" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e9e0f2;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="272" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-40" value="読出応答" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="272" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-41" value="【P】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="260