转 · 入口阀 · 加热;kind=on;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="561" y="472" width="298" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-136" value="断線" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=清洗机断线;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="861" y="500" width="208" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-137" value="【注記】" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="542" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-138" value="※1 洗浄機はアラーム読出に 3 回失敗しても「アラーム読出異常」を出すだけで、表示のみ・停止しない【推】。そのため PLC 自身が断線を判定して温水器を止める必要がある【P】。要求直後の「無」枠は、洗浄機がタイムアウトまで待ってから次を読むことを表す。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="564" width="1352" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-139" value="※2 PLC が断線と判定するまでの時間：暫定 5 s（500 ms × 10）、未定。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="602" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-140" value="※3 断線中に洗浄機が温度を書込むと（投入開始 / 停止）、「温度設定異常」→ 温水停止になる【推】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="622" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-141" value="※4 両側の断線ともリセットが必要：線が直ってもリセットしないと重故障 DO はクリアされない【P】。洗浄機自身の「アラーム読出異常」は画面で無条件に解除できる【推】。" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="642" width="1352" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-4" name="4-4 PLC 自身の電源断 / 停止 → 再起動 → リセット"><mxGraphModel dx="1380" dy="812" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1380" pageHeight="812" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-table" value="テーブル" style="locked=1;" parent="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-sig" value="信号" parent="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-1" value="4-4  PLC 自身の電源断 / 停止 → 再起動 → リセット" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-2" value="この図で答えること：PLC が電源断・停止したとき洗浄機と温水器はそれぞれどうなるか／PLC 復帰後の復旧方法" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1360" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-3" value="凡例：【推】洗浄機・温水器側の前提　【IO】IO 割付　【P】PLC 本案　【未】未定　【定】確定　｜　赤破線枠「無」= 応答なし" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1360" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-4" value="区分" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="100" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-5" value="信号" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="96" width="160" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-6" value="備考" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="96" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-8" value="温水供給中" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="560" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-10" value="PLC 電源断 / 停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="660" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-12" value="洗浄機&#xa;故障検知・停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="760" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-14" value="洗浄機&#xa;アラーム読出失敗" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="860" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-16" value="PLC 運転再開" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="960" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-18" value="PLC 温水器読出・&#xa;停止を再送" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-20" value="リセット ON&#xa;（約 5 s）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-22" value="リセット OFF・&#xa;チェック" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-23" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-24" value="温度設定異常" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="160" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-25" value="【推】温度書込失敗 3 回 → サイクル停止・温水停止" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="160" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-26" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="188" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="188" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-27" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-28" value="アラーム読出異常" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="188" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-29" value="【推】アラーム読出失敗 3 回 → 表示のみ" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="188" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-30" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="216" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="216" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-31" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-32" value="運転 / 通水" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="216" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-33" value="【推】重故障を見て OFF" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="216" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-34" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="244" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="244" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-35" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-36" value="温度書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="244" width="160" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-37" value="【推】停止時に 25.0 を書込" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meiryo,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="260" y="244" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-38" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="560" y="272" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="272" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-39" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="100" y="272" width="460" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-40" value="アラーム読出" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Meiryo UI,Yu Gothic UI,Meir